                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fa996fc0-ce3d-3260-911f-352c8955302a",
                        "entry_id": "f65f4804-3e36-39fa-bc51-c48cc51b74c0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui n’est pas coercible."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "physical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3ac6c7ef-1674-490e-b84a-76e19af74ab8",
                                "sense_id": "fa996fc0-ce3d-3260-911f-352c8955302a",
                                "text": "Force incoercible."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1ad4b313-90d3-3e46-a6d1-2969f1cd9217",
                        "entry_id": "f65f4804-3e36-39fa-bc51-c48cc51b74c0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui ne peut être arrêté, inarrêtable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d2bcae52-0c62-4614-a9c7-9cc19830ee92",
                                "sense_id": "1ad4b313-90d3-3e46-a6d1-2969f1cd9217",
                                "text": "Ce sont des rêveries que Marx regardait comme réactionnaires […], parce qu’il lui semblait que le capitalisme était entraîné dans la voie d’un progrès incoercible ; […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5451a6fe-2755-4981-8109-89a60a294ba1",
                                "sense_id": "1ad4b313-90d3-3e46-a6d1-2969f1cd9217",
                                "text": "Pendant que je lui remplissais la bouteille, il se demandait encore où il avait bien pu l’attraper cette toux incoercible."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6cd781bf-ec19-4900-b994-8bbd9f251a87",
                                "sense_id": "1ad4b313-90d3-3e46-a6d1-2969f1cd9217",
                                "text": "Son incoercible légèreté le conduit plus loin encore."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fff12aca-6817-49fd-8d7d-e1a0b325c9a3",
                                "sense_id": "1ad4b313-90d3-3e46-a6d1-2969f1cd9217",
                                "text": "Ainsi s'affirme, incoercible, le besoin réflexe d'ajuster notre condition à ce qu'elle est et non de suivre l’exclamation superlative des vertiges forains et des boules à facettes des bals pour séduire les filles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a417ad39-ca5b-4b40-ba0d-902bf2ca3680",
                                "sense_id": "1ad4b313-90d3-3e46-a6d1-2969f1cd9217",
                                "text": "A deux ans, si on me faisait avaler une boule de pain à l'intérieur de laquelle on avait dissimulé une infime parcelle de fromage, j'étais pris aussitôt de vomissements incoercibles."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a200d961-32dd-4aa8-8551-3308d571d75d",
                        "source_entry_id": "f65f4804-3e36-39fa-bc51-c48cc51b74c0",
                        "target_lang_word": "unstoppable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unstoppable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2fa2a19f-76f2-3004-8520-46c738905f8c",
                                        "entry_id": "d52897ee-1f2e-359f-9a15-bfe9bc4238ca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unable to be stopped."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "087e0ab7-614d-4611-820b-d010934c91e1",
                                                "sense_id": "2fa2a19f-76f2-3004-8520-46c738905f8c",
                                                "text": "Their \"greatly unstoppable fight\" against the cause was a joke."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "162aead1-59c4-4e01-a674-14d6cc39fa93",
                                                "sense_id": "2fa2a19f-76f2-3004-8520-46c738905f8c",
                                                "text": "In these early days of silent pictures, the accent was chiefly on thrills and danger as provided by supposedly unstoppable locomotives with crooks or maniacs on the footplate."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77d75dd2-0210-4443-852a-b8e96b66ac17",
                                                "sense_id": "2fa2a19f-76f2-3004-8520-46c738905f8c",
                                                "text": "However Russian Pavlyuchenko stunned his compatriots with an unstoppable 25-yard drive into the top corner."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8de8c845-2eab-45b5-a930-23070b56aca1",
                                                "sense_id": "2fa2a19f-76f2-3004-8520-46c738905f8c",
                                                "text": "I'm so powerful / I don't need batteries to play / I'm so confident / Yeah, I'm unstoppable today"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec603c51-5806-4a4a-9ab1-c851a054f616",
                                                "sense_id": "2fa2a19f-76f2-3004-8520-46c738905f8c",
                                                "text": "20 January 2017, Donald Trump, Inauguration Speech\nWhen America is united, America is totally unstoppable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93db8a2c-6796-4f64-9f87-7a401aa5bdc9",
                                                "sense_id": "2fa2a19f-76f2-3004-8520-46c738905f8c",
                                                "text": "These trains were ordered years before the pandemic, commissioned to tackle a problem that has (for now) gone away. Passenger numbers are no longer increasing at an unstoppable rate, driven by rising central London employment. The extra capacity is not currently needed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "19725982-447e-4716-8a8f-1edffbb2bbd7",
                        "source_entry_id": "f65f4804-3e36-39fa-bc51-c48cc51b74c0",
